s://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-arm64.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for Linux arm64 for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - portable package\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=linux-legacy&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-linux-legacy.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for 32-bit Linux for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - pre-AppImage \u00b7 SP Flash Tool\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://innioasis.app/firmware.html?repo=ryan-specter%2Fkoensayr-auto&amp;tag=2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2&amp;asset=rom.zip&amp;platform=macos&amp;mirror=y1-community%2Fkoensayr-auto-mirror\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/y1-community/koensayr-auto-mirror/main/.mirror-assets/release-button-macos.svg\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Download .zip for macOS 12+ for Y1 \u00b7 Type A - Intel + Apple silicon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n# 2.4.0-koensayr-3.0.2\n\nKoensayr is a mod for the Y1's OS that makes the following improvements to the original OS:\n\nBrowsing the albums of an artist from Main Menu > Artists > Albums\n\nAdds Bluetooth remote control support and track info displayed on your bluetooth receiver, perfect for using your Y1 in a car with the infotainment system.\n\n\n---\n\n## Build metadata\n\nPatched **rom.zip** built from stock **3.0.2** by [koensayr-auto](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto) v2.4.0.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- Repository: [`y1-community/y1-stock-rom`](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-stock-rom)\n- Release tag: `3.0.2`\n- Asset: `rom.zip`\n- Upstream SHA256: `7ee9aa5bf1c134f71e1f41d92cb90975f2225f9ad9db9617b392ddf653f764b1`\n\n## Koensayr build\n\n- Version: `2.4.0`\n- Git revision: `16f65333696597b084d34931d4c94f7c5352e9e5` (includes `com.innioasis.y1` APK patches under `src/patches/`)\n\n## Build output\n\n- Patched `rom.zip` SHA256: `a791e3de39a27978f15142be02d051fbac57c3e6a8d79088a73db0dbdb39f1b5` (see `build-manifest.json` on this release)\n- Upstream `rom.zip` was re-hashed at build time; output must differ (CI enforces this).\n\n## Patches (`--all`)\n\n- Music-player UX (Artist\u2192Album navigation)\n- Bluetooth pairing (`audio.conf` / `auto_pairing.conf` / `blacklist.conf` / `build.prop`)\n- System config (ADB debugging, bloatware removal)\n- Root (`/system/xbin/su`, mode 06755)\n- AVRCP 1.3 metadata + control + Y1Bridge\n\nDiagnostic scripts (`tools/dual-capture.sh`, gdb attach, `btlog-dump`) are **not** included in the ROM \u2014 see the repo [Diagnostics](https://github.com/ryan-specter/koensayr-auto#diagnostics).\n\n## After flash\n\nIf AVRCP / MultiDex classes fail to load after upgrading from a prior koensayr build:\n\n```bash\nadb shell rm -rf /data/data/com.innioasis.y1/code_cache/secondary-dexes/\n```\n\n<!-- portable-mirror:{\"assets\":[{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows\",\"sha256\":\"4f8648e0bfbc9fcccf87dabcf837ee6307ef420486733fd2f66ddf3f9046e8d3\",\"size\":570802497,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"windows-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"3ced5925c4bfd109e17425fbfe6b079332ffd51298b47e772d11c8f8dadca415\",\"size\":332563654,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux\",\"sha256\":\"448f3cc0284f2c2b9c37b68aba845ebeee6026f27ba2d5527cbce1faabecdd58\",\"size\":568694855,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-arm64\",\"sha256\":\"e95f8d8b3076e87734fed83d8b523066adad897db3749954ec66298241c13b2a\",\"size\":393600413,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\",\"platform\":\"linux-legacy\",\"sha256\":\"d5f08a43b599daeebe0be2eee7d0dd5cb9c6d99d87e951a92c6bf0a5974d1eba\",\"size\":330977937,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"},{\"model\":\"Y1\",\"name\":\"rom-macos.zip\",\"platform\":\"macos\",\"sha256\":\"17a1a856040aa7ed074cf40574807bb47693e2ed944703024aadc279db6b2e59\",\"size\":368813392,\"source_asset\":\"rom.zip\",\"type\":\"Type A\"}],\"built_at\":\"2026-11-21T01:30:54Z\",\"button_assets\":[{\"name\":\"release-button-updater.svg\",\"size\":1540},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows.svg\",\"size\":1522},{\"name\":\"release-button-windows-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1536},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux.svg\",\"size\":1518},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-arm64.svg\",\"size\":1510},{\"name\":\"release-button-linux-legacy.svg\",\"size\":1538},{\"name\":\"release-button-macos.svg\",\"size\":1516}],\"failures\":[],\"fingerprint\":\"1e4a90e57a8f2e3a794a5c742af15a5dc51355ed99e1e79d4f1437cd33407c51\",\"original_asset_sizes\":{\"build-manifest.json\":538,\"rom.zip\":328930606},\"original_assets\":[\"build-manifest.json\",\"rom.zip\"],\"platforms\":{\"linux\":\"d98956494e27e0c797d50a2547002b929ea712783d669b226947703bdd86638e\",\"linux-arm64\":\"1bbc1b2be4d14828df8a4ee66d2239052fe4fc0b71b74b0c1266cc94f3a44914\",\"linux-legacy\":\"4cec8ceaaf0f6739ba10d47d5ae4d248eb071a522281ef92ee77025a429c8d42\",\"macos\":\"f9fcc27aee996ee87d3121641a521d0ed34ffaff2ba75f9a7430d6520fa25af1\",\"windows\":\"4ffd038428d0431ac46b6525b70718037b24053cdc4383d82f29fcfdcb84dc4a\",\"windows-legacy\":\"9d8604af17745a1cad9acce6ca91d79e585e23ddd7eafec78048dd40949fa885\"},\"skipped\":[],\"source_fingerprint\":\"13ec65762658f4bf8bab3342bd4f93a729cd161df06081fdd2fefa846d0c80a8\",\"stats\":{\"baseline\":{\"build-manifest.json\":15,\"rom-linux-arm64.zip\":1,\"rom-linux-legacy.zip\":2,\"rom-linux.zip\":2,\"rom-macos.zip\":4,\"rom-windows-legacy.zip\":1,\"rom-windows.zip\":7,\"rom.zip\":10},\"generated_at\":\"2026-11-21T01:30:54Z\",\"retired\":{}},\"updater\":{\"linux\":{\"dri